<decision #track.make_subagent_delegation_autonomous.execution_policy {
  priority = "P0"
  status = "accepted"
  durable_candidate = true
  confidence = 0.99
}
(
  <question ?>普通 track 叶任务是否必须由 fresh 子代理执行？</?>
  <recommendation ?>普通任务由当前 AI 自主选择 local 或 delegated；只有独立性属于协议语义时强制 fresh context。</?>
  <answer { }
  (
    <raw-answer ?>除了 gap-loop、attractor review 等场景，其他应当由 AI 自主决定。</?>
    <decision-text ?>Codument SHALL separate orchestration, delegation, and independent validation. Ordinary leaf-task delegation is an AI execution choice, not a mandatory impl-track rule.</?>
    <rationale ?>任务结构不等于执行者拓扑；强制逐叶委派会增加等待、重复加载和状态冲突，却不能为普通实现提供额外正确性。</?>
    <evidence ?>当前 impl-track、workflow、dag-execution 和 tdd 文档均把普通任务硬编码为 fresh 子代理执行；本次 decision track 的过长执行暴露了该成本。</?>
  )
  >
)
>

<decision #track.make_subagent_delegation_autonomous.state_owner {
  priority = "P0"
  status = "accepted"
  durable_candidate = true
  confidence = 0.98
}
(
  <question ?>委派任务时谁拥有 track 执行状态？</?>
  <recommendation ?>track executor 是 track.xml、acceptance、findings 与 commit 的唯一写入者。</?>
  <answer { }
  (
    <raw-answer ?>同意该 track id 和行为。</?>
    <decision-text ?>Delegated workers SHALL return scoped outputs and evidence; the track executor SHALL exclusively verify and write completion state.</?>
    <rationale ?>避免 worker 与 parent 重复回写 status、勾选 acceptance 或创建冲突 commit。</?>
    <evidence ?>旧 impl-track 同时要求子代理和父层回写状态，存在双写语义。</?>
  )
  >
)
>

